Our Music - Desktop

This C# Windows application was developed as a desktop adaptation of the interface and features of Music You by Daniel Sevillano:
https://github.com/DanielSevillano/music-you

The original repository's GPL-3.0 license is retained in LICENSE. This is a separately maintained repository, not a GitHub fork. Independent repository status does not remove the original project's attribution or license terms.

The Windows implementation uses WPF. The Android Kotlin source and the original repository's Git history are not included here.

yt-dlp is downloaded separately from its official releases. Its license and executable dependency notices are documented at:
https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/blob/master/LICENSE

Node.js is an external dependency:
https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/main/LICENSE
